title: A New Chair
subtitle: The Caucus must choose who chairs one of its committees.
tags: event
view-if: appoint_ready = 1 and not finale and not game_ending
priority: 2
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_senate.svg
on-arrival: {! SW.appointOpen(Q); !}

= Who Chairs [+ ap_com_name +]?

The Caucus holds the chair of the [+ ap_com_name +] Committee. Whoever sits in it will decide what the committee puts to the Senate, and the Caucus's factions each want one of their own there.

- @a: [+ ap_a_name +] of [+ ap_a_world +].
- @b: [+ ap_b_name +] of [+ ap_b_world +].
- @c: [+ ap_c_name +] of [+ ap_c_world +].

@a
view-if: ap_a_ok
subtitle: [+ ap_a_faction +]. Their faction will be pleased.
on-arrival: {! SW.appointChoose(Q, 'a'); !}

[+ ap_chosen_name +] takes the chair of the [+ ap_com_name +] Committee. The [+ ap_chosen_faction +] are pleased to see one of their own in it.

@b
view-if: ap_b_ok
subtitle: [+ ap_b_faction +]. Their faction will be pleased.
on-arrival: {! SW.appointChoose(Q, 'b'); !}

[+ ap_chosen_name +] takes the chair of the [+ ap_com_name +] Committee. The [+ ap_chosen_faction +] are pleased to see one of their own in it.

@c
view-if: ap_c_ok
subtitle: [+ ap_c_faction +]. Their faction will be pleased.
on-arrival: {! SW.appointChoose(Q, 'c'); !}

[+ ap_chosen_name +] takes the chair of the [+ ap_com_name +] Committee. The [+ ap_chosen_faction +] are pleased to see one of their own in it.
